WHAT IS NOT COVERED. Three external tools are used but not vendored here, and
each carries its own licence: CaDiCaL and lrat-trim (Armin Biere and
co-authors), drat-trim (Nathan Wetzler, Marijn Heule and Warren Hunt), and
nauty/gentourng/labelg (Brendan McKay and Adolfo Piperno). The locally
transitive tournament catalogues in `tournaments/locally_transitive/` are
McKay's combinatorial data, redistributed here for the Appendix E verifier; see
`https://users.cecs.anu.edu.au/~bdm/data/digraphs.html`.
